[{"answer":"I've still got loads to do for our report on nutritional food labels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/2.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you learn from doing the project about your own shopping habits?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've always had to check labels for traces of peanuts in everything I eat because of my allergy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/4.mp3"},{"answer":"But beyond that I've never really been concerned enough to check how healthy a product is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/5.mp3"},{"answer":"This project has actually taught me to read the labels much more carefully.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I tended to believe claims on packaging like 'low in fat'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/7.mp3"},{"answer":"But I now realise that the 'healthy' yoghurt I've bought for years is full of sugar","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and that it's actually quite high in calories.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Ready meals are the worst...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/10.mp3"},{"answer":"comparing the labels on supermarket pizzas was a real eye-opener.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you have any idea how many calories they contain?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I was amazed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, because unless you read the label really carefully,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/14.mp3"},{"answer":"you wouldn't know that the nutritional values given are for half a pizza.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/15.mp3"},{"answer":"When most people eat the whole pizza.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Not exactly transparent is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Not at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/18.mp3"},{"answer":"But I expect it won't stop you from buying pizza?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Probably not, no!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought comparing the different labelling systems used by food manufactures was interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the kind of labelling system used makes a big difference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Which one did you prefer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I liked the traditional daily value system best -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/24.mp3"},{"answer":"the one which tells you what proportion of your required daily intake of each ingredient the product contains.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure it's the easiest for people to use but at least you get the full story.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to know all the ingredients in a product -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/27.mp3"},{"answer":"not just how much fat, salt and sugar they contain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/28.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's good supermarkets have been making an effort to provide reliable information for customers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. There just needs to be more consistency between labelling systems used by different supermarkets,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/30.mp3"},{"answer":"in terms of portion sizes, etc.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The labels on the different brands of chicken flavour crisps were quite revealing too, weren't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't understand how they can get away with calling them chicken flavour","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/34.mp3"},{"answer":"when they only contain artificial additives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd at least have expected them to contain a small percentage of real chicken.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I think having nutritional food labeling has been a good idea, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it will change people's behaviour and stop mothers, in particular, buying the wrong things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/40.mp3"},{"answer":"But didn't that study kind of prove the opposite?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/41.mp3"},{"answer":"People didn't necessarily stop buying unhealthy products.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/42.mp3"},{"answer":"They only said that might be the case.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Those findings weren't that conclusive and it was quite a small-scale study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I think more research has to be done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I think you're probably right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/46.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think of the traffic-light system?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I think supermarkets like the idea of having a colour-coded system -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/48.mp3"},{"answer":"red, orange or green - for levels of fat, sugar and salt in a product.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/49.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's not been adopted universally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And not on all products.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do you suppose that is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Pressure from the food manufacturers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Hardly surprising that some of them are opposed to flagging up how unhealthy their products are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd have thought it would have been compulsory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/55.mp3"},{"answer":"It seems ridiculous it isn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/57.mp3"},{"answer":"And what I couldn't get over is the fact that it was brought in without enough consultation -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/58.mp3"},{"answer":"a lot of experts had deep reservations about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/59.mp3"},{"answer":"That is a bit weird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose there's an argument for doing the research now when consumers are familiar with this system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, maybe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/62.mp3"},{"answer":"The participants in the survey were quite positive about the traffic-light system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/63.mp3"},{"answer":"But I don't think they targeted the right people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/64.mp3"},{"answer":"They should have focused on people with low literacy levels","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/65.mp3"},{"answer":"because these labels are designed to be accessible to them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/67.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's good to get feedback from all socio-economic groups.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And there wasn't much variation in their responses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/69.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/70.mp3"},{"answer":"But if they hadn't interviewed participants face-to-face,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/71.mp3"},{"answer":"they could have used a much bigger sample size.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder why they chose that method?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Dunno.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/74.mp3"},{"answer":"How were they selected?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Did they volunteer or were they approached?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they volunteered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/77.mp3"},{"answer":"The thing that wasn't stated was how often they bought packaged food -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/78.mp3"},{"answer":"all we know is how frequently they used the supermarket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-3-2023-03-25-05-34-24/79.mp3"}]
